<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-BBB-</p>
<p>Kajima Corp,</p>
<p>20 billion yen unsecured due 2002</p>
<p>20 billion yen unsecured due 2003</p>
<p>10 billion yen unsecured due 2004</p>
<p>10 billion yen unsecured due 2005</p>
<p>-BB-</p>
<p>Kawasaki Steel Corp, 10 billion yen unsecured due 2003</p>
<p>-B-</p>
<p>Royal Ltd, 0.49 billion yen unsecured with warrants due 2001</p>
</text>
